thesis_risk"},{"text":"GLP-1 disruption across sub-sectors \u2014 weight-loss drugs are reshaping demand for orthopaedics, cardiovascular devices, and sleep-apnea treatments in ways not yet priced in.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Valued at a 1940% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk","Healthcare sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 15% over 3 months","Healthcare ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average","Strong 6-month sector performance (30.3% return)","Healthcare tends to hold up well as investors rotate into defensive names"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Establishment Labs Holdings (ESTA) Lifts Outlook Following Q3 Results But Does Valuation Still Fit","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/healthcare/nasdaq-esta/establishment-labs-holdings/news/establishment-labs-holdings-esta-lifts-outlook-following-q3","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793982718.082,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.582,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings","guidance"]},{"title":"(ESTA) Price Dynamics and Execution-Aware Positioning","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/21/ESTA_Price_Dynamics_and_Execution-Aware_Positioning_110126014001_1793515201.html","date":"2026-11-01","timestamp":1793511601.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.494,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Establishment Labs (NASDAQ:ESTA) Stock Crosses Above Fifty Day Moving Average \u2013 Here\u2019s Why","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/10/30/establishment-labs-nasdaqesta-stock-crosses-above-fifty-day-moving-average-heres-why.html","date":"2026-10-31","timestamp":1793416874.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.772,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Establishment Labs (ESTA) Stock Slides After Q3 Earnings Turn Cash Positive","source":